### ============================================
### API TESTING - REST CLIENT (.http)
### ============================================
### Buka file ini di VS Code dengan Extension "REST Client"
### Kemudian klik "Send Request" di atas setiap request
###
### Pastikan:
### 1. API Gateway berjalan di http://localhost:8000
### 2. Ganti {{token}} dengan JWT token yang valid
### 3. Ganti {{id}} dengan ID yang ada di database
### ============================================

### VARIABLES
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...  # TODO: Ganti dengan token valid
@contentType = application/json

### GATEWAY SECRET (untuk direct service testing, jika tidak via gateway)
### Set di .env: INTERNAL_GATEWAY_SECRET=change_me_gateway_internal_secret
@gatewaySecret = change_me_gateway_internal_secret

### PENTING:
### ⚠️ Semua service-berita WAJIB diakses via API Gateway (port 8000)
### ⚠️ Pastikan API Gateway berjalan: npm run start -w apps/api-gateway
### ⚠️ Jika ada error 403 "Request harus melalui API Gateway":
###    - Pastikan @baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
###    - Pastikan API Gateway sudah running
###    - Check INTERNAL_GATEWAY_SECRET di .env

### ============================================
### 1. SERVICE BERITA - BERITA
### ============================================

### ✅ LIST BERITA (PUBLIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/berita
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ✅ LIST BERITA DENGAN PAGINATION
GET {{baseUrl}}/berita?page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ✅ DETAIL BERITA (PUBLIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/berita/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 🔒 CREATE BERITA (ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/berita
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Berita Test",
  "content": "Isi berita test",
  "category_id": 1,
  "slug": "berita-test"
}

### 🔒 EDIT BERITA (ADMIN, GURU)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/berita/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Berita Updated",
  "content": "Isi berita yang sudah diupdate",
  "category_id": 1
}

### 🔒 HAPUS BERITA (ADMIN)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/berita/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

---

