### ============================================
### TROUBLESHOOTING
### ============================================

### ❌ TEST 401 - UNAUTHORIZED (TANPA TOKEN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/berita
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ❌ TEST 403 - FORBIDDEN (TOKEN TAPI ROLE TIDAK SESUAI)
POST {{baseUrl}}/berita
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Test",
  "content": "Test content"
}

### ❌ TEST 404 - NOT FOUND (ID TIDAK ADA)
GET {{baseUrl}}/berita/999999
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ============================================
### TIPS PENGGUNAAN
### ============================================

### 1. Ganti variabel di atas:
###    @baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
###    @token = <JWT_TOKEN_VALID>

### 2. Klik "Send Request" di atas setiap request

### 3. Lihat response di panel sebelah kanan

### 4. Untuk POST/PUT, ubah body JSON sesuai kebutuhan

### 5. Simpan JWT token dari Keycloak login

### CARA MENDAPAT TOKEN:
### 1. Login ke http://localhost:8080
### 2. Ambil access token dari response
### 3. Paste ke @token variable di atas

### Format: Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
